WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Fresh parent: two native agents, forked and fresh context

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
F6, F, Down: filter Active and highlight without switching

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Enter: inspect the running forked-context child

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Hollow circle + cursor: selected row; solid circle: open session

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Inspect the fresh-context child; parent-managed input stays disabled

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Return to Main: unsent draft and Active filter restored

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Done: inspect the completed source review

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Return to Main: known completion survives subscription unload

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Failed: explicit empty state; Main remains selectable

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:17.000
A: stop-turn confirmation defaults to Cancel

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Both complete: assignment, model, context, and frozen elapsed time
